Momo Hidden Gems

Momo Hidden Gems is a curated collection of the most fascinating and lesser-known aspects of the Momo universe. This project aims to uncover and showcase unique features, stories, and experiences that often go unexplored.

Overview
Name: momo-hidden-gems
Version: 1.0.0
Main File: universe.js
Testing: Uses Jest with full coverage reporting

Key Features
A dedicated library to explore hidden elements within Momo.
Comprehensive test coverage with Jest.
Structured for easy expansion and modular updates.

Getting Started
Clone the repository:
git clone http://local_proxy@127.0.0.1:58433/git/momomelis/Momo-hidden-gems
Navigate to the project directory and install dependencies:
npm install
Run tests to verify setup:
npm test

